WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:01.734 line:8%
JOSH HAWLEY: You've
referred to people

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:03.602 line:14%
with a capacity for pregnancy.

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:04.571 line:14%
Would that be women?

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:08.674 line:8%
KHIARA BRIDGES: Many
women, cis women,

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:10.042 line:14%
have the capacity for pregnancy.

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:13.112 line:8%
Many cis women do not have
the capacity for pregnancy.

00:00:13.213 --> 00:00:15.581 line:8%
There are also trans men who
are capable of pregnancy,

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:17.883 line:8%
as well as non-binary people
who are capable of pregnancy.

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:21.287
[music playing]

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:27.827
JOSH HAWLEY: So this isn't
really a women's rights issue.

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:28.928
It's a what?

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:30.029
KHIARA BRIDGES: We can
recognize that this

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.897
impacts women while
also recognizing

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:33.233
that it impacts other groups.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:36.236
Those things are not mutually
exclusive, Senator Hawley.

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:39.805
JOSH HAWLEY: So your view is
that the core of this right,

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:41.807
then, is about what?

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:43.776
KHIARA BRIDGES: So
I want to recognize

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:47.513
that your line of
questioning is transphobic,

00:00:47.614 --> 00:00:49.649
and it opens up trans
people to violence

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:51.117
by not recognizing them.
JOSH HAWLEY: Wow.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:52.952
You're saying that I'm
opening up people to violence

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:55.288
by asking whether or not
women are the folks who

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:56.122
can have pregnancies?

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:57.457
KHIARA BRIDGES: So I'm--

00:00:57.557 --> 00:01:01.127
I want to note that one out
of five transgender persons

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:02.895
have attempted suicide.

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:04.029
So I think it's
important for us--

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:05.298
JOSH HAWLEY: Because of
my line of questioning?

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:06.332
KHIARA BRIDGES: --because--

00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:07.667
JOSH HAWLEY: So we
can't talk about it?

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:09.269
KHIARA BRIDGES: --because
denying that trans people exist

00:01:09.369 --> 00:01:11.804
and pretending not to know
that they exist is dangerous.

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:13.806
JOSH HAWLEY: I'm denying that
trans people exist by asking--

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:15.041
KHIARA BRIDGES: Are you?

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:15.908
JOSH HAWLEY: --you if
you're talking about women--

00:01:16.009 --> 00:01:16.876
KHIARA BRIDGES: Are you?
Are you?

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:18.211
JOSH HAWLEY:
--having pregnancies?

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:19.446
KHIARA BRIDGES: Do you believe
that men can get pregnant?

00:01:19.546 --> 00:01:21.046
JOSH HAWLEY: No, I don't
think men can get pregnant.

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:21.981
KHIARA BRIDGES:
So you are denying

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:23.049
that trans people exist.
Thank you.

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:24.017
JOSH HAWLEY: And that
leads to violence.

00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:25.150
Is this how you
run your classroom?

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:26.986
Are students allowed
to question you--

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:28.387
KHIARA BRIDGES: Absolutely.

00:01:28.488 --> 00:01:29.722
JOSH HAWLEY: --or are they also
treated like this, where you--

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:30.923
KHIARA BRIDGES: No, no, no.
They're allowed to question.

00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:31.624
JOSH HAWLEY: --they're
told that they're opening

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:32.859
up people to violence--

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:34.260
KHIARA BRIDGES: Oh, we have
a good time in my class.

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:34.961
JOSH HAWLEY: --by questioning.
KHIARA BRIDGES: You should join.

00:01:35.061 --> 00:01:35.995
JOSH HAWLEY: Oh, I bet.

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:36.629
KHIARA BRIDGES: You
might learn a lot.

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:37.296
JOSH HAWLEY: Wow.

00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:38.531
I would learn a lot.

00:01:38.631 --> 00:01:39.599
I've learned a lot--
KHIARA BRIDGES: You-- I know.

00:01:39.699 --> 00:01:40.934
JOSH HAWLEY: --just
from this exchange.

00:01:41.034 --> 00:01:41.600
KHIARA BRIDGES: Absolutely.
JOSH HAWLEY: Extraordinary.

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:42.168
KHIARA BRIDGES: Yep.

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:43.536
[music playing]

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:58.017
[cnn jingle]

